  "Pale Skin":"I have noticed unusual paleness in my skin and palms.",
  "Swelling in Feet/Legs":"I have swelling and puffiness in my feet and legs.",
  "Palpitations":"I am experiencing rapid and irregular heartbeat sensations.",
  "Dizziness / Vertigo":"I am feeling dizzy with a spinning sensation.",
  "Fainting":"I have been having episodes of feeling faint and losing consciousness.",
  "High Blood Pressure":"I have been diagnosed with or am experiencing high blood pressure.",
