  "Excessive Thirst":"I am feeling excessively thirsty despite drinking enough water.",
  "Frequent Urination":"I have been urinating more than usual throughout the day.",
  "Burning Urination":"I am experiencing a burning sensation while urinating.",
  "Blood in Urine":"I have noticed blood in my urine which is alarming.",
  "Back Pain":"I am suffering from persistent pain in my back.",
  "Joint Pain":"I am experiencing pain and stiffness in my joints.",
  "Knee Pain":"I am having persistent pain and discomfort in my knee.",
  "Neck Pain":"I am suffering from stiffness and pain in my neck.",
  "Shoulder Pain":"I am experiencing pain in my shoulder joint.",
  "Numbness / Tingling":"I am feeling numbness and tingling sensation in my hands and feet.",
  "Tremors":"I have involuntary shaking or tremors in my hands.",
